  "title": "Toyota to Build a New Vehicle Manufacturing Plant in India",
  "summary": "Toyota Motor Corporation (Toyota) announces plans to build a new Toyota Kirloskar Motor plant in the Bidkin industrial Area, Maharashtra, India. The new plant is planned to start production in the first half of 2029 and is aimed to strengthen Toyota's business foundation in the Indian market.",
